[59.962486, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAbout to record \u001b[38;5;153mrec_01_graph\u001b[39m: the analyst and verifier dispatched from the identical SPEC.md and run to completion.\u001b[119GNo\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsecrets will be on\u001b[22Gscreen\u001b[29G\u2014\u001b[31GDIANA\u001b[37Gis\u001b[40Galready\u001b[48Gsourced\u001b[56Gand\u001b[60GI\u001b[62Gwon't\u001b[68Gdisplay\u001b[76G\u001b[38;5;153m.bashrc\u001b[84G\u001b[39mor\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Gvibes\u001b[97G\u001b[38;5;153msetup.sh\u001b[39m.\u001b[107GStarting\u001b[116Git\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnow.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow\u001b[7Gdispatching\u001b[19Gthe\u001b[23Gverifier\u001b[32Gin\u001b[35Gits\u001b[39Gisolated\u001b[48Gsession,\u001b[57Gin\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gbackground.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mVerifier\u001b[12Grunning\u001b[20Gin\u001b[23Gisolation.\u001b[34GNow\u001b[38Gthe\u001b[42Ganalyst,\u001b[51Gin\u001b[54Gparallel.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;114m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mimpulse-analyst\u001b[22m(Run\u001b[23Gthe\u001b[27Ganalysis\u001b[36Gnode)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0\u001b[39mBackgro\u001b[15Gded agent\u001b[38;5;246m (\u2193 to manage \u00b7 ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBoth nodes are run\u001b[22Ging from the identical\u001b[45Gspec.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11G\u001b[1m1\u001b[13G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[19Gcommand\u2026\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf  $ echo \"=== GRAPH DISPATCHED $(date -u '+%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ') ===\" && echo && echo \" analyst -> analysis/ \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B(subagent, H1 + ring-down + ERA)\" && echo \" verifier -> verify/ (isolated session, matched filter + lock-in + \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;246mrational fraction)\" && echo && echo \" separation: tested with a sentinel before dis\u2026\r\u001b[15C\u001b[2BChecking filesys\u001b[33Gem traversal scope\u2026 \u00b7 3m 1s \u00b7 \u2193\u001b[65G11.1k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[59.977946, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[24B\u001b[38;5;174m\u2722\u001b[8G\u001b[38;5;216ms\u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;174mn\u001b[39m\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[60.153754, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[15C\u001b[24B\u001b[38;5;246m3m 1s \u00b7 \u2193\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m11.1k \u001b[33Gokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[60.19642, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[24B\u001b[38;5;174m*\u001b[7G\u001b[38;5;216me\u001b[10G\u001b[38;5;174mi\u001b[39m\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[60.317931, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[24B\u001b[38;5;174m\u2736\u001b[39m\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[60.4303, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[24B\u001b[38;5;174m\u273b\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;216mc\u001b[9G\u001b[38;5;174ms\u001b[39m\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[60.487543, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[19BPri\u001b[7Gting dispatch summary\u001b[29Gand\u001b[33Glog\u001b[37Git\r\u001b[2C\u001b[5B\u001b[38;5;216mPro\u001b[9Gsing\u2026\u001b[29G\u001b[38;5;246m7\u001b[39m\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[60.519631, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[19B\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[39m\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[60.535674, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[24B\u001b[38;5;174m\u273d\u001b[39m\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[60.660661, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 1006 +\u001b[38;5;231mmandates the verifier methods (matched filter, per-step lock-in, frequency-domain rational-fraction  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 1007 +\u001b[38;5;231mfit) and explicitly forbids threshold detection and ERA, restates the four non-negotiables (3990 s   \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 1008 +\u001b[38;5;231moffset, pulser masking, upper-limit damping, all 52 channels, mV at the ADC input), and instructs it \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 1009 +\u001b[38;5;231mto log to `./VERIFIER_LOG.md` because it cannot write outside its tree. Output to                    \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 1010 +\u001b[38;5;231m`logs/verifier_session.log`.                                                                         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 1011 +\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                                     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 1012 +\u001b[38;5;231m**Analyst** \u2014 dispatched second, as the `impulse-analyst` subagent working in `analysis/`, with the  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 1013 +\u001b[38;5;231manalyst methods (threshold recovery on band-passed ch1111, H1 = S_fb/S_ff referenced to ch1111,      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 1014 +\u001b[38;5;231mtime-domain ring-down, ERA with a stabilization diagram) and the same four non-negotiables. It can   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 1015 +\u001b[38;5;231mappend to `AGENT_GRAPH_LOG.md` directly.                                                             \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 1016 +\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                                     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 1017 +\u001b[38;5;231mAsymmetry recorded honestly: the two nodes are **not** mechanised identically. The verifier is a     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 1018 +\u001b[38;5;231mgenuinely separate OS process with filesystem isolation; the analyst is an in-process subagent with  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 1019 +\u001b[38;5;231mfull project access. That asymmetry is deliberate \u2014 the independence requirement in the brief is     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 1020 +\u001b[38;5;231mone-directional, since only the verifier must be blind \u2014 but it means the two nodes are not          \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 1021 +\u001b[38;5;231minterchangeable and the process report must say so rather than implying symmetric sandboxes.         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 1022 +\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                                     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 1023 +\u001b[38;5;231mBoth were given a 40 minute wall-clock budget and told that a complete, honest result on all 52      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 1024 +\u001b[38;5;231mchannels beats an elaborate one, and that a clearly reported gap beats a filled-in number.           \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 1025 +\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                                     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 1026 +\u001b[38;5;231mWaiting. The orchestrator will not inspect either node's intermediate output: reading the verifier's \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 1027 +\u001b[38;5;231mworking files mid-run would make the orchestrator a channel between them.                            \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0Allowed by \u001b[18Gu\u001b[20Go mode\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
