[71.968663, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[9G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m11\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231m       \u001b[21G      \u001b[28G        \u001b[37G           \u001b[49G        \u001b[58G   \u001b[62G  \u001b[65G         \u001b[75G  \u001b[78G  \u001b[81G   \u001b[85G   \u001b[89G       \u001b[97G   \u001b[101G         \u001b[111G  \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m12\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231m**Analyst** \u2014 dispatched second, \u001b[47Gs the `impulse-analyst` subagent working in `analysis/`,\u001b[104Gwith\u001b[109Gthe\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m3\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231manalyst methods (threshold recovery\u001b[49Gon\u001b[52Gband-passed\u001b[64Gch1111,\u001b[72GH1\u001b[75G=\u001b[77GS_fb/S_ff\u001b[87Greferenced\u001b[98Gto\u001b[101Gch1111,\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m4\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231mtime-domain\u001b[25Gring-down,\u001b[36GERA\u001b[40Gwith\u001b[45Ga\u001b[47Gstabilization\u001b[61Gdiagram)\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Gsame\u001b[83Gfour\u001b[88Gnon-negotiables.\u001b[105GIt\u001b[108Gcan\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m5\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231mappend to `AGENT_GRAPH_LOG.md` direc\u001b[50Gly.                 \u001b[71G        \u001b[80G       \u001b[88G  \u001b[91G            \u001b[104G    \u001b[109G   \r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m6\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231m       \u001b[21G       \u001b[29G          \u001b[40G        \u001b[49G  \u001b[52G           \u001b[64G       \u001b[72G  \u001b[75G \u001b[77G         \u001b[87G          \u001b[98G  \u001b[101G       \r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m7\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231mAsymmetry recorde\u001b[31G honestly: \u001b[44Ge two nodes are **not** mechanis\u001b[77Gd id\u001b[82Gntically. The verifier\u001b[105Gis\u001b[108Ga  \r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m8\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231mgenuinely\u001b[23Gseparate OS process with fi\u001b[51Gesystem\u001b[59Gisolation;\u001b[70Gthe\u001b[74Ganalyst\u001b[82Gis\u001b[85Gan\u001b[88Gin-process\u001b[99Gsubagent\u001b[108Gwith\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m9\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231mfull\u001b[18Gproject\u001b[26Gaccess.\u001b[34GThat\u001b[39Gasymmetry\u001b[49Gis\u001b[52Gdeliberate\u001b[63G\u2014\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gindependence\u001b[82Grequirement\u001b[94Gin\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gbrief\u001b[107Gis\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m20\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231mone-directional, since on\u001b[40G the verifier must be blind\u001b[68G\u2014 but \u001b[75Gt means \u001b[84Ghe two nod\u001b[95Gs a\u001b[99Ge not\u001b[105G  \u001b[108G \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m21\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231minterchangeable and the process report mu\u001b[56G say so rather than implying\u001b[85Gsymmetric sandboxes.  \u001b[108G    \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m22\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231m    \u001b[18G       \u001b[26G       \u001b[34G    \u001b[39G         \u001b[49G  \u001b[52G          \u001b[63G \u001b[65G   \u001b[69G            \u001b[82G           \u001b[94G  \u001b[97G   \u001b[101G     \u001b[107G  \r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m3\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231mBoth were given a 40 minute\u001b[41Gwall-clock budge\u001b[59Gand tol\u001b[68Gthat a co\u001b[78Gplete, honest result on all\u001b[106G52\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m4\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231mchannels b\u001b[25Gts an elaborate one, and \u001b[51Ghat a\u001b[57Gclearly repo\u001b[70Gted gap beats a filled-in num\u001b[100Ger.  \r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m5\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B6\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231mWaiting. The orchestrator will not inspect \u001b[57Gither\u001b[63Gn\u001b[65Gde's intermediate output: reading\u001b[99Gthe verifier's\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m7\u001b[13G\u001b[38;5;231mworking files mid-run would\u001b[41Gmake\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gorchestrato\u001b[62G a\u001b[65Gchannel between \u001b[82Ghem.         \u001b[96G       \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0Allowed by auto mode\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBoth nodes are running and I won't inspect their intermediate work \u2014 reading the verifier's files mid-run would\u001b[115Gmake\r\u001b[1B  me a channel between them.\u001b[30GWhile\u001b[36Gthey\u001b[41Gwork,\u001b[47Glet\u001b[51Gme\u001b[54Gfix\u001b[58Gsomething\u001b[68GI\u001b[70Gnoticed\u001b[78Gin\u001b[81Gthat\u001b[86Gtimestamp.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;246m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunni\u001b[9Gg \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command\u2026\u001b[K\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
