[106.2092, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m nty on every bolometer amplitude. In fact 8.0108642578125e-02 is exactly 21000/2**18, the LSB of a +/-1\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m 0.5 V 18-bit digitiser, so it is a DAQ-board property identical for all channels and the arrays are exa\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m ctly mV at the ADC input.\",wrong method or convention,orchestrator,\"Vivek asked whether the uncertainty\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m  could be resolved, which prompted testing the number against candidate full-scale/bit combinations ins\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m tead of treating it as an opaque constant\",\"SPEC.md 2.1 item 3 rewritten: scale exact at the ADC, chann\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m el_gain.csv to be reported in mV at the ADC input and labelled so, claims of bolometer volts/temperatur\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m e/energy forbidden without asking. The genuinely undetermined per-channel front-end gain is in the DB a\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m nd is not needed, since all spec quantities are scale-free. meta.json provenance string still to be cor\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m rected before dispatch.\",11\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 23 +\u001b[38;5;231mE022,2026-10-31T04:20Z,3,orchestrator,\"Every timestamp heading in AGENT_GRAPH_LOG.md after about 02:40 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231mUTC was overstated by up to 122 minutes. After the first two entries the orchestrator wrote plausible c\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mlock times from its own sense of progress instead of calling date, and the drift compounded. True elaps\u001b[115G\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231med at graph dispatch was 131 min, not the 253 min the headings implied. Entry ordering and the per-item\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231m cost_min estimates are unaffected; the absolute headings are not trustworthy.\",fabricated or unsupport\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231med claim,orchestrator,The dispatch banner printed a real date -u of 04:18:07Z alongside a log entry hea\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231mded 06:20Z written moments earlier,\"Correction entry appended (nothing edited, per the append-only rule\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231m). New convention: every heading timestamp comes from date -u at the moment of writing. Anchors for the\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231m cost table: session start 02:07Z, graph dispatch 04:18Z. Also withdraws the orchestrator's earlier rec\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mommendation to drop Step 6, which rested on the wrong elapsed figure: the true position is 2.18 h of a \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231m5 h budget used with about 11.7 h to the deadline.\",4                                                  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0(another command ran in\u001b[30Gthis r\u001b[37Gposi\u001b[44Gy at the same tim\u001b[62G; a change made by either may show under either \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bresult)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0Allowed by auto mode\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
