u001b[113Gn the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bprocess repo\u001b[16Gt rests o\u001b[26G a negative test,\u001b[44Gnot an \u001b[52Gnstruction.\u001b[64GThe se\u001b[71Gtinel stays\u001b[83Gin place so any later\u001b[105Gbreach is\u001b[115G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdetectable.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOne honest asymmetry\u001b[24Glogged:\u001b[32Gthe\u001b[36Gverifier\u001b[45Gis\u001b[48Ga\u001b[50Gseparate\u001b[59GOS\u001b[62Gprocess\u001b[70Gwith\u001b[75Gfilesystem\u001b[86Gisolation,\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Ganalyst\u001b[109Gis\u001b[112Gan\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bin-process\u001b[14Gsubagent\u001b[23Gwith\u001b[28Gfull\u001b[33Gproject\u001b[41Gaccess.\u001b[49GThat's\u001b[56Gdeliberate\u001b[67G\u2014\u001b[69Gonly\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Gverifier\u001b[87Gneeds\u001b[93Gto\u001b[96Gbe\u001b[99Gblind\u001b[105G\u2014\u001b[107Gbut\u001b[111Gthe\u001b[115Gtwo\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnodes aren't int\u001b[20Grchangeable\u001b[32Gand\u001b[36Gthe report will s\u001b[54Gy so.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mI had to correct my own record, and it's E022.\u001b[22m The di\u001b[57Gpatch\u001b[63Gbanner\u001b[70Gprinted\u001b[78Ga\u001b[80Greal\u001b[85G\u001b[38;5;153mdate -u\u001b[93G\u001b[39mof\u001b[96G\u001b[38;5;153m04:18Z\u001b[103G\u001b[39mnext\u001b[108Gto\u001b[111Ga\u001b[113Glog\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bentry\u001b[9GI'd\u001b[13Gheaded\u001b[20G\u001b[38;5;153m06:20Z\u001b[39m.\u001b[28G\u001b[1mEvery heading after ~02:40 was overstated, by up to 122 minutes\u001b[92G\u001b[22m\u2014\u001b[94Gafter\u001b[100Gthe\u001b[104Gfirst\u001b[110Gcouple\u001b[117Gof\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bentries I wrote plausible-looking times from my s\u001b[53Gnse of progress instead of\u001b[80Gcal\u001b[84Ging \u001b[38;5;153mdate\u001b[39m. Logged as \"fabric\u001b[112Gted or\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bu\u001b[5Gsupported claim\", since I asserted numbers I hadn't measured. Nothing edited, per the append-only rule; new\u001b[K\r\u001b[2