[490.669108, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 120 \u001b[22m   bolometer output, so the estimate survives \u2014 but variance is inflated and coherence depressed.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 121 \u001b[22m   **Report coherence per frequency; do not assume it.**\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m2\u001b[12G\u001b[22m-\u001b[14GFrequ\u001b[20Gncy\u001b[24Gste\u001b[28Gs are 250 s and **250 / 10 =\u001b[57G25 exactly**, so the pulser arrives at an *id\u001b[103Gntical\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m...\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m55\u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 156 \u001b[22m State these as not-applicable rather than passing or failing them:\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 156 -\u001b[38;5;231m- **No amplitude variation at fixed frequency.** The drive is constant (verified elsewhere: 0.1\u20130.2%  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m 157 -\u001b[38;5;231m  over 13 repeats). Measured force varies ~25% *across* frequency, which is the shaker and stinger    \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m8\u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;231m \u001b[14Gresponse, not a d\u001b[33Gve change. **No linearity test and no\u001b[71Gquadratic-\u001b[82Ghermal-path test is possible  \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m9\u001b[14G\u001b[38;5;231mfrom\u001b[19Gthis run.** \u001b[32G        \u001b[41G     \u001b[47G      \u001b[54G    \u001b[59G        \u001b[68G          \u001b[79G     \u001b[85G  \u001b[88G   \u001b[92G      \u001b[99G   \u001b[103G       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 158 +\u001b[38;5;231m- **No amplitude variation at fixed frequency.** Each frequency occurs exactly once in this run, so   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 159 +\u001b[38;5;231m  **no linearity test and no quadratic-thermal-path test is possible from it.**                       \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m60\u001b[16G\u001b[38;5;231mThe drive force \u001b[33Gs *not* smooth\u001b[48Gacross frequency,\u001b[66Gand part of it may be instrumental.**\u001b[104GForce RMS\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m61\u001b[14G\u001b[38;5;231mspans 365\u20131521\u001b[29GmV, a fact\u001b[40Gr **4.16**, and cont\u001b[61Gins two\u001b[69G**step discontinu\u001b[88Gies**:\u001b[95G**+71%\u001b[102Gbetween\u001b[110G5.4\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m2\u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;231m \u001b[14Gand 5.5 Hz** and **\u221232% between 7.4 and 7.5 Hz**. A\u001b[66Go\u001b[68Ge-step\u001b[75G71% ju\u001b[82Gp cannot be smooth shake\u001b[107G and  \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m3\u001b[15G\u001b[38;5;231mti\u001b[18Gger response; a reference-channel\u001b[52Grange or amplifier gain\u001b[76Gchange \u001b[84Gs a\u001b[88G least\u001b[95Gas likely. Form   \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m4\u001b[14G\u001b[38;5;231mevery transfer function\u001b[38Gas a strict\u001b[50Gratio to ch1111\u001b[66G**on \u001b[72Ghe\u001b[75Gsame step**, wher\u001b[95Guch a\u001b[101Gc\u001b[104Gnge\u001b[108G   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;246m\u2026 5 more lines \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0Allowed by auto mode\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
