[541.834699, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231m of trusting exit code 0,\"Fixed: 16 allow rules added (Write/Edit/Read under verify/, Read on the two d\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231mata directories, python3 and the pyR python, read-only shell tools) with the 12 deny rules retained and\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231m still taking precedence. Verifier re-dispatched. Lesson for the report: an exit code and a DONE marker\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231m are not evidence of work.\",26                                                                         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 26 +\u001b[38;5;231mE025,2026-10-31T04:33Z,2,orchestrator,\"data/steps.csv published 25 s FFT bin centres as measured drive \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m   +\u001b[38;5;231mfrequencies, so \u001b[28Gvery value\u001b[39Gwas quantis\u001b[51Gd to 0\u001b[58G04\u001b[61GHz and the column altern\u001b[86Gted +0.08/+0.12 Hz i\u001b[107Gstead\u001b[113Go\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m   +\u001b[38;5;231mf\u001b[13Ga u\u001b[17Giform 0.1 Hz. The stated b\u001b[44Gnd 2.52-9.52 Hz was\u001b[64Gwrong for the same reason; it\u001b[94Gis\u001b[97G2.50-9.50\u001b[107GHz.\",wr\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m   +\u001b[38;5;231mong metho\u001b[21G or convent\u001b[33Gon,verifier,\"The verifier noticed every frequency was an exact multiple \u001b[106Gf 0.04 H\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m   +\u001b[38;5;231mz,\u001b[14Gone 25 s DFT bin, and infe\u001b[41Gred a true\u001b[52G0.1\u001b[56GHz gr\u001b[62Gd rounded \u001b[73Go the estimator's resolution\",\"st\u001b[107Gps.csv\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m   +\u001b[38;5;231mrewritten:\u001b[22Geach\u001b[27Gstep's frequ\u001b[40Gncy measured over\u001b[58Gits full 250 s dwell\u001b[79Gby \u001b[83Gar\u001b[86Gbolic interpolation on the\u001b[113Gl\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m   +\u001b[38;5;231mog-mag\u001b[18Gitude \u001b[26Gectrum,\u001b[34Gabout 4 mHz, plus\u001b[52Gan f_drive_hz_nominal colum\u001b[80G. Band correc\u001b[94Ged to 2.50-9.50 Hz\u001b[113Gt\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m   +\u001b[38;5;231mhroughout meta.json and SPEC.md.\",15  \u001b[50G     \u001b[56G  \u001b[59G      \u001b[66G    \u001b[71G   \u001b[75G    \u001b[80G       \u001b[88G     \u001b[94G    \u001b[99G \u001b[101G      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 27 +\u001b[38;5;231mE026,2026-10-31T04:38Z,2,verifier,\"From the quantised steps.csv the verifier inferred the drive grid mi\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mght be 2.52+0.1k, hence f mod 0.1 = 0.02 Hz, which would place the drive frequencies about five 250 s b\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231mins off the pulser comb and make SPEC section 4.1's masking requirement too pessimistic. The inference \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mwas wrong: the grid is 2.5+0.1k.\",physics error,orchestrator,\"Measured the drive frequency on ch1111 ov\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231mer each full dwell at about 4 mHz resolution; the grid is f_k = 2.5+0.1k Hz with max deviation 0.00017 \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mHz, so f mod 0.1 < 0.0002 Hz\",\"Refuted and recorded. Drive frequencies ARE multiples of 0.1 Hz, there i\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231ms no frequency separation to exploit, and time-domain masking remains mandatory. SPEC 4.1 kept and stre\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231mngthened with the measured numbers. Mitigating note: the verifier itself flagged that this had to be me\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231masured off ch1111 rather than assumed, so it proposed the test that refuted its own hypothesis.\",12    \r\u001b[1B\u0