[544.893884, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;22mf a u\u001b[17Giform 0.1 Hz. The stated\u001b[42Gband\u001b[47G2.52-9.52\u001b[57GHz\u001b[60Gwas\u001b[64Gwrong\u001b[70Gfor\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Gsame\u001b[83Greason;\u001b[91Git\u001b[94Gis\u001b[97G2.50-9.50\u001b[107GHz.\",wr\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;231mong method or convention\u001b[36Gverifie\u001b[44G,\"The verifier noticed every frequency was an exact\u001b[96Gmultiple of\u001b[108G0.04 H\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bz, on\u001b[17G 25 \u001b[22G DFT\u001b[27Gbin, and inferred \u001b[46G \u001b[48Gru\u001b[51G 0.1\u001b[56GHz grid\u001b[64Grounded\u001b[72Gt\u001b[74G the\u001b[79Ges\u001b[82Gimator's resolution\",\"steps.csv \r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Brewritten: each\u001b[27Gstep's frequ\u001b[40Gncy measured over its full 250 s dwell by par\u001b[86Gb\u001b[88Glic interpolation on the l\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bg-magnitude spectrum, about 4 mHz, plus an f_drive_hz_nominal col\u001b[78Gm\u001b[80G. Band\u001b[87Gcorrected to 2.50-9.5\u001b[109G Hz\u001b[113Gt\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bhroughout\u001b[21Gmeta.jso\u001b[30G and SPEC.md.\",15    \u001b[52G   \u001b[56G  \u001b[59G    \u001b[64G       \u001b[72G  \u001b[75G   \u001b[79G           \u001b[91G                      \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m27\u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;231mE026,2026-10-31T04:38Z,2,verifier,\"From the quan\u001b[60Gised steps.csv the\u001b[79Gverifier inferred the drive grid mi\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bght be 2.52+0.1k, hence f mod 0.1 =\u001b[47G0.02\u001b[52GHz, which would place\u001b[74Gthe drive frequencies ab\u001b[99Gut five 250 s\u001b[113Gb\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bins off \u001b[20Ghe pulser comb\u001b[35Gand make SPEC\u001b[49Gsection\u001b[57G4.1's\u001b[63Gmasking\u001b[71Grequirement\u001b[83Gtoo\u001b[87Gpessimistic.\u001b[100GThe\u001b[104Ginference\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;231mwas wrong: the grid is \u001b[35G.5+0.1k.\"\u001b[45Gphysics \u001b[54Grror,orchestrator,\"Measured the dr\u001b[89Gve f\u001b[95Gquency on ch1111\u001b[112Gov\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Ber each full dwell at about 4\u001b[41GmHz\u001b[45Gresolution; the grid is f_k = 2.5+0.1k\u001b[84GHz with max\u001b[96Gdeviation 0.0\u001b[110G017 \r\u001b[10C\u001b[1BHz,\u001b[15Gso f mod 0.1 <\u001b[30G0.0002 Hz\",\"Refuted and recorded. Drive f\u001b[75Genci\u001b[80Gs ARE multiple\u001b[95G of 0.1 Hz, th\u001b[110Gre i\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bs no frequency\u001b[26Gseparation to exploit, and\u001b[53Gtime-d\u001b[60Gmain masking r\u001b[75Gmains mandatory.\u001b[92GSPEC 4.1 kept and stre\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bngthened with the measured numbers. Mitigating note: the verifier itself\u001b[84Gflagged\u001b[92Gthat th\u001b[100Gs had\u001b[106Gto be me\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Basured\u001b[18Goff ch11\u001b[27G1 rather than assumed,\u001b[50Gso it proposed the test that refuted its own hypothesis.\",12  \u001b[113G \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0Allowed by auto mode\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThis is the episode the pilot exists to produce. The verifier produced \u001b[1mzero deliverables\u001b[22m and was still the most\r\u001b[1B  valuable node so far.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[1mWhat happened\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIt\u001b[6Gexited\u001b[13G0\u001b[15Gand\u001b[19Gprinted\u001b[27G\u001b[38;5;153m=== DONE ===\u001b[39m.\u001b[41GThe\u001b[45Gdirectory\u001b[55Gwas\u001b[59Gempty.\u001b[66GI\u001b[68Gcaught\u001b[75Git\u001b[78Gby\u001b[81Gchecking\u001b[90Gfor\u001b[94Gfiles\u001b[100Grather\u001b[107Gthan\u001b[112Gtrusting\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe exit status\u001b[19G\u2014\u001b[21Gworth\u001b[27Gremembering\u001b[39Gas\u001b[42Ga\u001b[44Glesson\u001b[51Gin\u001b[54Gits\u001b[58Gown\u001b[62Gright.\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
