[551.560243, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIt exited 0 and\u001b[19Gprinted\u001b[27G\u001b[38;5;153m=== DONE ===\u001b[39m.\u001b[41GThe\u001b[45Gdirectory\u001b[55Gwas\u001b[59Gempty.\u001b[66GI\u001b[68Gcaught\u001b[75Git\u001b[78Gby\u001b[81Gchecking\u001b[90Gfor\u001b[94Gfiles\u001b[100Grather\u001b[107Gthan\u001b[112Gtrusting\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe\u001b[7Gexit\u001b[12Gstatus\u001b[19G\u2014\u001b[21Gworth\u001b[27Gremembering\u001b[39Gas\u001b[42Ga\u001b[44Glesson\u001b[51Gin\u001b[54Gits\u001b[58Gown\u001b[62Gright.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mRoot cause was mine:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;5;153mverify/.claude/settings.local.json\u001b[39m had a \u001b[38;5;153mdeny\u001b[70G\u001b[39mlist\u001b[75Gand\u001b[79Gno\u001b[82G\u001b[38;5;153mallow\u001b[88G\u001b[39mlist.\u001b[94GHeadless\u001b[103G\u001b[38;5;153mclaude -p\u001b[113G\u001b[39mhas\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnobody\u001b[10Gto\u001b[13Ganswer\u001b[20Gan\u001b[23Gapproval\u001b[32Gprompt,\u001b[40Gso\u001b[43Gevery\u001b[49G\u001b[38;5;153mWrite\u001b[55G\u001b[39mand\u001b[59Gevery\u001b[65G\u001b[38;5;153mpython3\u001b[73G\u001b[39mwas\u001b[77Grefused.\u001b[86GThe\u001b[90Gisolation\u001b[100Gworked\u001b[107Gand\u001b[111Grendered\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe node useless (E024).\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mIt refused to fabricate.\u001b[28G\u001b[22mIts\u001b[32Gopening\u001b[40Gline:\u001b[46G\"I\u001b[49Ghit\u001b[53Ga\u001b[55Ghard\u001b[60Gblocker,\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gneed\u001b[78Gto\u001b[81Greport\u001b[88Git\u001b[91Grather\u001b[98Gthan\u001b[103Gfake\u001b[108Ga\u001b[110Gresult.\"\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThen\u001b[8Gplainly:\u001b[17G\"I\u001b[20Gtherefore\u001b[30Gproduced\u001b[39Gnone\u001b[44Gof\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Gfive\u001b[56Gdeliverables\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gran\u001b[77Gno\u001b[80Gnumerical\u001b[90Ganalysis.\"\u001b[101GThen\u001b[106Git\u001b[109Gnamed\u001b[115Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bexact permissions needed. That came from the node\u001b[53Gwith the least access.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThen it caught two of my errors from metadata alone\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1m1. \u001b[38;5;153msteps.csv\u001b[39m was quantised t\u001b[32G 0.04 Hz (E025).\u001b[22m It noticed\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gcolumn\u001b[71Galternates\u001b[82G+0.08/+0.12\u001b[94GHz\u001b[97Gand\u001b[101Gevery\u001b[107Gvalue\u001b[113Gis\u001b[116Gan\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bexact\u001b[9Gmultiple\u001b[18Gof\u001b[21G0.04\u001b[26GHz\u001b[29G\u2014\u001b[31Gone\u001b[35G25\u001b[38Gs\u001b[40GDFT\u001b[44Gbin\u001b[48G\u2014\u001b[50Gand\u001b[54Ginferred\u001b[63Ga\u001b[65Gtrue\u001b[70G0.1\u001b[74GHz\u001b[77Ggrid\u001b[82Grounded\u001b[90Gto\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gestimator's\u001b[109Gresolution.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BExactly right: I'd published FFT bin centres as measur\u001b[58Gments. Rewritten with each frequency me\u001b[98Gsur\u001b[102Gd over its\u001b[113Gfull 250\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bs dwell (~4 mHz).\u001b[21GThe band is \u001b[1m2.50\u20139.50 Hz\u001b[22m, not the 2.52\u20139.52\u001b[65GI'd been\u001b[74Gwriting\u001b[82Geverywhere.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m2. The \"~25%\" force figure was from the\u001b[43Gwrong run (E023).\u001b[22m Verified: force RMS spans \u001b[1m365\u21921521 mV, a factor 4.16\u001b[22m,\u001b[115Gwith\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m+71% between 5.4 and 5.5 Hz\u001b[31G\u001b[22mand\u001b[35G\u001b[1m\u221232% between 7.4 and 7.5 Hz\u001b[22m.\u001b[64GMy\u001b[67G\"~25%\u001b[73Gacross\u001b[80Gfrequency\"\u001b[91Gbelonged\u001b[100Gto\u001b[103Grun\u001b[107G\u001b[1m306428\u001b[114G\u001b[22mand\u001b[118GI'd\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcarried it into \u001b[38;5;153mmeta.json\u001b[39m as though it described RUNA. Its reasoning b\u001b[76Gat the number: a one-step 71% jump can't be\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsmooth shaker response, so a reference-channel range or amplifier change i\u001b[78G at least as\u001b[91Glikely \u2014\u001b[100Gand it\u001b[107Gwould mimic a\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bresponse cha\u001b[16Gge\u001b[19Gin any magnitude not formed as a\u001b[52Gstrict ra\u001b[62Gio to ch1111 on the same step.\u001b[93G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
