[553.149495, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mRoot cause was mine:\u001b[24G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;153mverify/.claude/settings.local.json\u001b[59G\u001b[39mhad\u001b[63Ga\u001b[65G\u001b[38;5;153mdeny\u001b[70G\u001b[39mlist\u001b[75Gand\u001b[79Gno\u001b[82G\u001b[38;5;153mallow\u001b[88G\u001b[39mlist.\u001b[94GHeadless\u001b[103G\u001b[38;5;153mclaude -p\u001b[113G\u001b[39mhas\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnobody to answer an approval prompt, so every \u001b[38;5;153mWrite\u001b[39m and\u001b[59Gevery\u001b[65G\u001b[38;5;153mpython3\u001b[39m was refused. The isolation worked and rendered\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe node useless\u001b[20G(E024).\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mIt refused to fabricate.\u001b[28G\u001b[22mIts\u001b[32Gopening\u001b[40Gline:\u001b[46G\"I\u001b[49Ghit\u001b[53Ga\u001b[55Ghard\u001b[60Gblocker,\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gneed\u001b[78Gto\u001b[81Greport\u001b[88Git\u001b[91Grather\u001b[98Gthan\u001b[103Gfake\u001b[108Ga\u001b[110Gresult.\"\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThen plainly: \"I therefore pr\u001b[33Gduced none of the five deliverables\u001b[73Gran no numerical an\u001b[93Glysis.\" Then it named \u001b[116Ghe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bexact permissions n\u001b[23Geded. That came\u001b[39Gfrom\u001b[44Gthe node with the least access.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThen it caught two of my errors from metadata alone\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m1. \u001b[38;5;153msteps.csv\u001b[39m was quantised to 0.04 Hz (E025).\u001b[49G\u001b[22mIt\u001b[52Gnoticed\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gcolumn\u001b[71Galternates\u001b[82G+0.08/+0.12\u001b[94GHz\u001b[97Gand\u001b[101Gevery\u001b[107Gvalue\u001b[113Gis\u001b[116Gan\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bexact multiple of 0.04 Hz \u2014 one 25 s DFT bin \u2014 and inf\u001b[58Grred a tr\u001b[68Ge 0.1 Hz grid\u001b[82Grounded to the\u001b[97Gestimator's resolution.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BE\u001b[8Gly right:\u001b[18GI'd published FFT bin\u001b[40Gcentres\u001b[48Gas measur\u001b[58Gments.\u001b[65GRewritten with each fr\u001b[88Gquency mea\u001b[99Gured \u001b[105Gver\u001b[109Git\u001b[112G f\u001b[115Gll 250\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bs dwe\u001b[9Gl\u001b[11G(~4 mHz). The band is \u001b[1m2.50\u20139.50 Hz\u001b[22m, not\u001b[51Gthe 2.52\u20139.52\u001b[65GI'd been wr\u001b[78Ging everywhere.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m2. The \"~25%\" force figure was from the wrong run (E023).\u001b[61G\u001b[22mVerified:\u001b[71Gforce\u001b[77GRMS\u001b[81Gspans\u001b[87G\u001b[1m365\u21921521 mV, a factor 4.16\u001b[22m,\u001b[115Gwith\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m+71% between 5.4 and 5.5 Hz\u001b[22m and \u001b[1m\u221232% b\u001b[42Gt\u001b[44Gee\u001b[47G 7.4 and 7.5 Hz\u001b[22m. My \"~25% a\u001b[75Gross frequency\" belonged to run \u001b[1m306428\u001b[22m and I'd\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcarried it into \u001b[38;5;153mmeta.json\u001b[39m as though it described RUNA. Its\u001b[64Greasoning beat the n\u001b[85Gmber:\u001b[91Ga one-step 71% jump can't be\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsmooth shaker response, so a\u001b[32Greference-channel range or amplifier change is\u001b[79Gat least as\u001b[91Glikely \u2014 and it would mimic a\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bresponse change in any magnitude not formed as\u001b[50Ga strict\u001b[59Gratio to ch1111 on the\u001b[82Gsame step.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m3. One of its inferences was wrong, and I refuted it (E026).\u001b[64G\u001b[22mFrom\u001b[69Gthe\u001b[73Gquantised\u001b[83Gtable\u001b[89Git\u001b[92Ghypothesised\u001b[105Gthe\u001b[109Ggrid\u001b[114Gwas\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;153m2.52 + 0.1k\u001b[39m, so \u001b[38;5;153mf mod 0.1 = 0.02 Hz\u001b[39m \u2014 which would put the drive ~5 bins off the\u001b[83Gpuls\u001b[88Gr comb and mak\u001b[103G my mask\u001b[112Gng\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmandate too pessimistic. I measured\u001b[39Gch1111 over each full\u001b[62Gwell: the grid is \u001b[38;5;153mf_k = 2.5 + 0.1k\u001b[39m, \u001b[1mmax deviation 0.17 mHz\u001b[22m.\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
