3mf_k = 2.5 + 0.1k\u001b[39m, \u001b[1mmax deviation 0.17 mHz\u001b[22m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe drive frequenc\u001b[22Ges are multipl\u001b[37Gs\u001b[39Gof 0.\u001b[46GHz. No freq\u001b[58Gency separation exists; masking stays mandatory. To its credit\u001b[K\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
