[554.090252, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mIt refused to fabricate.\u001b[22m Its\u001b[32Gopening\u001b[40Glin\u001b[44G: \"I\u001b[49Ghit a\u001b[55Ghard blocker, and\u001b[73Gneed to r\u001b[83Gport it rather than fake a result.\"\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BT\u001b[6Gn plainly: \"I\u001b[20Gtherefore\u001b[30Gproduced\u001b[39Gnone\u001b[44Gof\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Gfive\u001b[56Gdeliverables\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gran\u001b[77Gno\u001b[80Gnumerical\u001b[90Ganalysis.\"\u001b[101GThen\u001b[106Git\u001b[109Gnamed\u001b[115Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bexact\u001b[9Gpermissions\u001b[21Gneeded.\u001b[29GThat\u001b[34Gcame\u001b[39Gfrom\u001b[44Gthe\u001b[48Gnode\u001b[53Gwith\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Gleast\u001b[68Gaccess.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThen it caught two of my errors from metadata alone\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m1. \u001b[38;5;153msteps.csv\u001b[39m was quantised to 0.04 Hz (E025).\u001b[49G\u001b[22mIt\u001b[52Gnoticed\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gcolumn\u001b[71Galternates\u001b[82G+0.08/+0.12\u001b[94GHz\u001b[97Gand\u001b[101Gevery\u001b[107Gvalue\u001b[113Gis\u001b[116Gan\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bexact multiple of 0.04 Hz \u2014 one 25 s DFT bin \u2014 and inferred\u001b[63Ga\u001b[65Gtrue\u001b[70G0.1\u001b[74GHz\u001b[77Ggrid\u001b[82Grounded\u001b[90Gto\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gestimator's\u001b[109Gresolution.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BExactly\u001b[11Gright:\u001b[18GI'd\u001b[22Gpublished\u001b[32GFFT\u001b[36Gbin\u001b[40Gcentres\u001b[48Gas\u001b[51Gmeasurements.\u001b[65GRewritten\u001b[75Gwith\u001b[80Geach\u001b[85Gfrequency\u001b[95Gmeasured\u001b[104Gover\u001b[109Gits\u001b[113Gfull\u001b[118G250\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bs dwell (~4 mHz). The band is \u001b[1m2\u001b[35G50\u20139.50 Hz\u001b[22m, not the 2.52\u20139.52 I'd been w\u001b[76Giting\u001b[82Geverywhere.\u001b[94G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m2. The \"~25%\" force figure was from the wrong run (E023).\u001b[22m Verified: force RMS spans \u001b[1m365\u21921521 mV, a factor 4.16\u001b[22m, with\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m+71% between 5.4 and 5.5 Hz\u001b[22m and \u001b[1m\u221232% between 7.4 and 7.5 Hz\u001b[22m. My \"~25% ac\u001b[76Goss fr\u001b[83Gquency\" belonged\u001b[100Gto\u001b[103Grun\u001b[107G\u001b[1m306428\u001b[114G\u001b[22mand\u001b[118GI'd\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcarried\u001b[11Git\u001b[14Ginto\u001b[19G\u001b[38;5;153mmeta.json\u001b[29G\u001b[39mas\u001b[32Gthough\u001b[39Git\u001b[42Gdescribed\u001b[52GRUNA.\u001b[60GIts\u001b[64Greasoning\u001b[74Gbeat\u001b[79Gthe\u001b[83Gnumber:\u001b[91Ga\u001b[93Gone-step\u001b[102G71%\u001b[106Gjump\u001b[111Gcan't\u001b[117Gbe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsmooth shaker response, so a reference-channel range or amplifier change is at lea\u001b[86Gt as likely \u2014 and it would mim\u001b[117Gc a\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bresponse change in any magnitu\u001b[34Ge not formed as a strict ratio to ch1111 on the sam\u001b[86G step.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m3. One of its inferences was wrong, and I refuted it (E026).\u001b[22m From\u001b[69Gt\u001b[71Ge quantised t\u001b[85Gble it hypothesised \u001b[106Ghe grid was\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;153m2.52 + 0.1k\u001b[39m, so\u001b[19G\u001b[38;5;153mf mod 0.1 = 0.02 Hz\u001b[39m \u2014 which\u001b[47Gwould put \u001b[58Ghe drive ~5 bins\u001b[76Gff the pulser comb\u001b[95Gand\u001b[99Gmake\u001b[104Gmy\u001b[107Gmasking\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmandate\u001b[11Gtoo\u001b[15Gpessimistic.\u001b[28GI\u001b[30Gmeasured\u001b[39Gch1111\u001b[46Gover\u001b[51Geach\u001b[56Gfull\u001b[61Gdwell:\u001b[68Gthe\u001b[72Ggrid\u001b[77Gis\u001b[80G\u001b[38;5;153mf_k = 2.5 + 0.1k\u001b[39m,\u001b[98G\u001b[1mmax deviation 0.17 mHz\u001b[22m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe drive frequencies are multiples of 0.1 Hz. No frequency separa\u001b[70Gion exist\u001b[80G; masking sta\u001b[94Gs mandatory. To its\u001b[114Gcredit\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit had written that this \"must be measured off ch1111, not assumed\" \u2014 it proposed th\u001b[88G test that\u001b[99Gkilled its ow\u001b[113G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhypoth\u001b[10Gsis.\u001b[15G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
