 mod 0.1 = 0.02 Hz\u001b[39m \u2014 which would put the drive ~5 bins off the\u001b[83Gpuls\u001b[88Gr comb and mak\u001b[103G my mask\u001b[112Gng\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmandate too pessimistic. I measured\u001b[39Gch1111 over each full\u001b[62Gwell: the grid is \u001b[38;5;153mf_k = 2.5 + 0.1k\u001b[39m, \u001b[1mmax deviation 0.17 mHz\u001b[22m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe drive frequenc\u001b[22Ges are multipl\u001b[37Gs\u001b[39Gof 0.\u001b[46GHz. No freq\u001b[58Gency separation exists; masking stays mandatory. To its credit\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit had writt\u001b[16Gn that this \"\u001b[31Gs\u001b[33G be measured\u001b[46Goff\u001b[50Gch1111, not a\u001b[64Gsumed\" \u2014 it proposed the test that killed its\u001b[110Gown\u001b[114G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhypothesis.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mIsolation held.\u001b[19G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;153mgrep -ril SENTINEL-7Q4X verify/\u001b[51G\u001b[39mreturns\u001b[59Gnothing,\u001b[68Gand\u001b[72Git\u001b[75Gvolunteered\u001b[87Gthat\u001b[92Git\u001b[95Gread\u001b[100G\u001b[38;5;153mverify/SPEC.md\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mbecause \"the project-root copy is outside my allowed direc\u001b[62Gories\" \u2014 confirmi\u001b[80Gg th\u001b[85G boundary\u001b[95Gfrom\u001b[100Gthe inside.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mState\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BVerifier\u001b[12Gre-dispatched\u001b[26Gwith\u001b[31Gall\u001b[35Gfour\u001b[40Gfindings\u001b[49Gadjudicated\u001b[61Gone\u001b[65Gby\u001b[68Gone.\u001b[73G\u001b[38;5;153mmeta.json\u001b[83G\u001b[39mand\u001b[87G\u001b[38;5;153mSPEC.md\u001b[95G\u001b[39mcorrected;\u001b[106Gthe\u001b[110GSPEC\u001b[115G\u00a74.1\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bchange is logged with old text,\u001b[35Gnew text a\u001b[46Gd reason as the brief\u001b[68Grequires. The analyst is still running against\u001b[115Gthe\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bprevious text, but both changes\u001b[35Gonly tighten\u001b[50Gquiremen\u001b[59Gs it was\u001b[68Galready meeting, and it was told to recover \u001b[114Geps\u001b[K\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[556.560004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3Gs dwell (~4 mHz).\u001b[21GThe band is \u001b[1m2.50\u20139.50 Hz\u001b[22m, not the 2.52\u20139.52\u001b[65GI'd been\u001b[74Gwriting\u001b[82Geverywhere.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m2. The \"~25%\" force figure was from the\u001b[43Gwrong run (E023).\u001b[22m Verified: force RMS spans \u001b[1m365\u21921521 mV, a factor 4.16\u001b[22m,\u001b[115Gwith\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m+71% between 5.4 and 5.5 Hz\u001b[31G\u001b[22mand\u001b[35G\u001b[1m\u221232% between 7.4 and 7.5 Hz\u001b[22m.\u001b[64GMy\u001b[67G\"~25%\u001b[73Gacross\u001b[80Gfrequency\"\u001b[91Gbelonged\u001b[100Gto\u001b[103Grun\u001b[107G\u001b[1m306428\u001b[114G\u001b[22mand\u001b[118GI'd\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcarried it into \u001b[38;5;153mmeta.json\u001b[39m as though it described RUNA. Its reasoning b\u001b[76Gat the number: a one-step 71% jump can't be\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsmooth shaker response, so a reference-channel range or amplifier change i\u001b[78G at least as\u001b[91Glikely \u2014\u001b[100Gand it\u001b[107Gwould mimic a\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bresponse cha\u001b[16Gge\u001b[19Gin any magnitude not formed as a\u001b[52Gstrict ra\u001b[62Gio to ch1111 on the same step.\u001b[93G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m3. One of its inferences was wrong, and I refuted it (E026).\u001b[22m Fr\u001b[67Gm the qua\u001b[77Gtis\u001b[81Gd table it hypothesised\u001b[105Gthe\u001b[109Ggrid\u001b[114Gwas\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;153m2.52 + 0.1k\u001b[39m,\u001b[16Gso\u001b[19G\u001b[38;5;153mf mod 0.1 = 0.02 Hz\u001b[39G\u001b[39m\u2014\u001b[41Gwhich\u001b[47Gwould\u001b[53Gput\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Gdrive\u001b[67G~5\u001b[70Gbins\u001b[75Goff\u001b[79Gthe\u001b[83Gpulser\u001b[90Gcomb\u001b[95Gand\u001b[99Gmake\u001b[104Gmy\u001b[107Gmasking\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmandate too pessimistic. I measured ch1111 over each full dwell: the grid is \u001b[38;5;153mf_k = 2.5 + 0.1k\u001b[39m, \u001b[1mmax deviation 0.17 mHz\u001b[22m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe drive frequencies are multiples\u001b[39Gof 0.1 Hz. No\u001b[53Gfrequency separatio\u001b[73G exists; masking\u001b[90Gstays mand\u001b[101Gtory.\u001b[107GTo its credit\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit h\u001b[8Gd written that \u001b[24Ghis\u001b[28G\"must be measured\u001b[47Gff ch1111, not assumed\" \u2014 it proposed the test that killed its own\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhypothesis.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mIsolation held.\u001b[19G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;153mgrep -ril SENTINEL-7Q4X verify/\u001b[51G\u001b[39mreturns\u001b[59Gnothing,\u001b[68Gand\u001b[72Git\u001b[75Gvolunteered\u001b[87Gthat\u001b[92Git\u001b[95Gread\u001b[100G\u001b[38;5;153mverify/SPEC.md\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mbecause\u001b[11G\"the\u001b[16Gproject-root\u001b[29Gcopy\u001b[34Gis\u001b[37Goutside\u001b[45Gmy\u001b[48Gallowed\u001b[56Gdirectories\"\u001b[69G\u2014\u001b[71Gconfirming\u001b[82Gthe\u001b[86Gboundary\u001b[95Gfrom\u001b[100Gthe\u001b[104Ginside.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mState\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BVerifier\u001b[12Gre-dispatched\u001b[26Gwith\u001b[31Gall\u001b[35Gfour\u001b[40Gfindings\u001b[49Gadjudicated\u001b[61Gone\u001b[65Gby\u001b[68Gone.\u001b[73G\u001b[38;5;153mmeta.json\u001b[83G\u001b[39mand\u001b[87G\u001b[38;5;153mSPEC.md\u001b[95G\u001b[39mcorrected;\u001b[106Gthe\u001b[110GSPEC\u001b[115G\u00a74.1\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bchange\u001b[10Gis\u001b[13Glogged\u001b[20Gwith\u001b[25Gold\u001b[29Gtext,\u001b[35Gnew\u001b[39Gtext\u001b[44Gand\u001b[48Greason\u001b[55Gas\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Gbrief\u001b[68Grequires.\u001b[78GThe\u001b[82Ganalyst\u001b[90Gis\u001b[93Gstill\u001b[99Grunning\u001b[107Gagainst\u001b[115Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bprevious\u001b[12Gt\u001b[14Gxt, bu\u001b[21G both changes\u001b[35Gonly\u001b[40Gt\u001b[42Gghten requirements\u001b[61Git was\u001b[68Galready meeting, and it was told \u001b[102Go recover steps\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bitself\u001b[10Grather than \u001b[23Grust \u001b[38;5;153msteps.csv\u001b[39m.\u001b[39G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
