[557.030441, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m2. The \"~25%\" force figure was from th\u001b[42G \u001b[44Gro\u001b[47Gg run (E023).\u001b[22m Verified: for\u001b[75Ge RMS spans \u001b[1m365\u21921521 mV, a factor 4.16\u001b[22m, with\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m+71% between 5.4 and 5.5 Hz\u001b[22m and \u001b[1m\u221232% between 7.4 and 7.5 Hz\u001b[22m.\u001b[64GMy \"~25% across freq\u001b[85Gency\"\u001b[91Gbelonged to run \u001b[1m306428\u001b[22m and I'd\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcarried it into \u001b[38;5;153mmeta.json\u001b[39m as\u001b[32Gthough it described RUNA. Its reasoning beat\u001b[79Gthe number:\u001b[91Ga one-step 71% jump can't be\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsmooth shaker response, so a reference-channel\u001b[50Grange or\u001b[59Gamplifier change is at\u001b[82Gleast as likely\u001b[98G\u2014\u001b[100Gand\u001b[104Git\u001b[107Gwould\u001b[113Gmimic\u001b[119Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bresponse\u001b[12Gchange\u001b[19Gin\u001b[22Gany\u001b[26Gmagnitude\u001b[36Gnot\u001b[40Gformed\u001b[47Gas\u001b[50Ga\u001b[52Gstrict\u001b[59Gratio\u001b[65Gto\u001b[68Gch1111\u001b[75Gon\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gsame\u001b[87Gstep.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m3. One of its inferences was wrong, and I refuted it (E026).\u001b[22m From the quantised\u001b[83Gtabl\u001b[88G it hypothesis\u001b[103Gd the gr\u001b[112Gd was\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;153m2.52 + 0.1k\u001b[39m, so \u001b[38;5;153mf mod 0.1 = 0.02 Hz\u001b[39G\u001b[39m\u2014 which would put the\u001b[62Grive ~5 bins off the pulser comb and make my masking\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmandate too pessim\u001b[22Gstic. I measur\u001b[37Gd\u001b[39Gch111\u001b[46Gover each f\u001b[58Gll dwell: the grid is \u001b[38;5;153mf_k = 2.5 + 0.1k\u001b[39m, \u001b[1mmax deviation 0.17 mHz\u001b[22m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe drive fr\u001b[16Gquencies are \u001b[31Gl\u001b[33Giples of 0.1\u001b[46GHz.\u001b[50GNo frequency \u001b[64Geparation exists; masking stays mandatory. To\u001b[110Gits\u001b[114Gcredit\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit had written\u001b[18Gthat\u001b[23Gthis\u001b[28G\"must\u001b[34Gbe\u001b[37Gmeasured\u001b[46Goff\u001b[50Gch1111,\u001b[58Gnot\u001b[62Gassumed\"\u001b[71G\u2014\u001b[73Git\u001b[76Gproposed\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gtest\u001b[94Gthat\u001b[99Gkilled\u001b[106Gits\u001b[110Gown\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhypothesis.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mIsolation held.\u001b[22m \u001b[38;5;153mgrep -ril SENTINEL-7Q4X verify/\u001b[39m returns no\u001b[62Ghing, and it volu\u001b[80Gteer\u001b[85Gd that it\u001b[95Gread\u001b[100G\u001b[38;5;153mverify/SPEC.md\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mbecause\u001b[11G\"the\u001b[16Gproject-root\u001b[29Gcopy\u001b[34Gis\u001b[37Goutside\u001b[45Gmy\u001b[48Gallowed\u001b[56Gdirectories\"\u001b[69G\u2014\u001b[71Gconfirming\u001b[82Gthe\u001b[86Gboundary\u001b[95Gfrom\u001b[100Gthe\u001b[104Ginside.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mState\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BVerifier re-dispatched with all\u001b[35Gfour findi\u001b[46Ggs adjudicated one by\u001b[68Gone. \u001b[38;5;153mmeta.json\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;5;153mSPEC.md\u001b[39m corrected; the SPEC\u001b[115G\u00a74.1\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bchange is logged with old text,\u001b[35Gnew text and\u001b[50Gason as \u001b[59Ghe brief\u001b[68Grequires. The analyst is still running again\u001b[114G the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bprevious \u001b[13Gext, but\u001b[22Gboth changes only\u001b[40Gtighten\u001b[48Grequirements\u001b[61Git\u001b[64Gwas\u001b[68Galready\u001b[76Gmeeting,\u001b[85Gand\u001b[89Git\u001b[92Gwas\u001b[96Gtold\u001b[101Gto\u001b[104Grecover\u001b[112Gsteps\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bitself\u001b[10Grather\u001b[17Gthan\u001b[22Gtrust\u001b[28G\u001b[38;5;153msteps.csv\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BLedger\u001b[10Gis\u001b[13Gnow\u001b[17G26\u001b[20Gentries.\u001b[29GThe\u001b[33G\u001b[38;5;153mcaught_by\u001b[43G\u