[751.5914, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G3.0 and above 9.0.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m12 modes.\u001b[13G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[17Gheadline:\u001b[27G\u001b[1m3.420 Hz, \u03b6 reported as an upper limit of 0.90%\u001b[75G\u001b[22m\u2014\u001b[77Gsitting\u001b[85Ginside\u001b[92Gthe\u001b[96Gcollaboration's\u001b[112Gown\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.35\u20133.55\u001b[13GHz hunt region. Four more modes in \u001b[1m8.0\u20139.0 Hz\u001b[22m, their second hunt reg\u001b[82Gon. And \u001b[1mno half-power \u03b6 was reported \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Banywhere\u001b[22m,\u001b[13Gbeca\u001b[18Gse\u001b[21Gno m\u001b[26Gde\u001b[29Gspans \u22653 point\u001b[45G\u2014 exactly the regime\u001b[66G\u00a74.3 predicted, with the upper-limit mechanism used as\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdesigned rather than\u001b[24Ga number invented.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe pulser trap is now demonstrated, not just predicted.\u001b[60G\u001b[22mIt\u001b[63Gmasked\u001b[70G\u001b[38;5;153m[t_p\u22120.1, t_p+1.0]\u001b[89G\u001b[39mon\u001b[92Gall\u001b[96G1777\u001b[101Gpulses\u001b[108G(~11%\u001b[114Gof\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsamples) and built a synthetic test: an unmasked step-aligned \u001b[66Gtack produces a \u001b[1m>20\u03c3 fake response\u001b[22m; the masked one\u001b[117Gdoes\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnot. E019 went from inference \u2192 phase measurem\u001b[50Gnt \u2192 end-to-\u001b[63Gnd demonstration.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIt\u001b[6Galso\u001b[11Gdeclared\u001b[20Gits\u001b[24Gown\u001b[28Ggaps\u001b[33Gunprompted:\u001b[45GERA\u001b[49G\u03b6\u001b[51Gsystematics\u001b[63Gundetermined,\u001b[77G\u03b6\u001b[79Gbelow\u001b[85G~0.2%\u001b[91Gunresolved,\u001b[103Gthe\u001b[107G8.10/8.17\u001b[117Gpair\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band 4.89 clust\u001b[18Gr\u001b[20Gpoorly separated, \u001b[39God\u001b[42G shapes unin\u001b[56Grpreted.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThree more o