[752.594748, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[1manywhere\u001b[22m,\u001b[13Gbecause no mode spans \u22653 points \u2014 exactly the regime \u00a74.3 predicted, with the upp\u001b[95Gr-limit mecha\u001b[109Gi\u001b[111Gm used\u001b[118Gas\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdesigned rather \u001b[20Ghan a \u001b[27Gumber invented.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe pulser trap is now demonstrated, not just predicted.\u001b[60G\u001b[22mIt\u001b[63Gmasked\u001b[70G\u001b[38;5;153m[t_p\u22120.1, t_p+1.0]\u001b[89G\u001b[39mon\u001b[92Gall\u001b[96G1777\u001b[101Gpulses\u001b[108G(~11%\u001b[114Gof\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsamples)\u001b[12Gand\u001b[16Gbuilt\u001b[22Ga\u001b[24Gsynthetic\u001b[34Gtest:\u001b[40Gan\u001b[43Gunmasked\u001b[52Gstep-aligned\u001b[65Gstack\u001b[71Gproduces\u001b[80Ga\u001b[82G\u001b[1m>20\u03c3 fake response\u001b[22m;\u001b[102Gthe\u001b[106Gmasked\u001b[113Gone\u001b[117Gdoes\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnot. E019 went from inference \u2192 phase measurement \u2192 end-to-end d\u001b[68Gmonstration.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIt also declared its own gaps\u001b[33Gun\u001b[36Grompted: ERA \u03b6 syst\u001b[56Gmatics undetermined, \u03b6 below\u001b[85G~0.2%\u001b[91Gunresolved,\u001b[103Gthe\u001b[107G8.10/8.17\u001b[117Gpair\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band\u001b[7G4.89\u001b[12Gcluster\u001b[20Gpoorly\u001b[27Gseparated,\u001b[38Gmode\u001b[43Gshapes\u001b[50Guninterpreted.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThree more of my errors, caught by the analyst\u001b[50G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mE028 \u2014 th\u001b[14Gbrief's phy\u001b[26Gics is wrong.\u001b[22m PT lines are\u001b[53Gat\u001b[56G\u001b[1m1.39443 Hz\u001b[22m,\u001b[68Gnot\u001b[72G1.4.\u001b[77GIndependently\u001b[91Gconfirmed\u001b[101Gabove.\u001b[108GThe\u001b[112Gcritic's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BPT\u001b[6Gcheck\u001b[12Gmust\u001b[17Guse\u001b[21Gthe\u001b[25Gright\u001b[31Gfundamental\u001b[43Gor\u001b[46G