eta.json\u001b[39m) and the ver\u001b[95Gfier is liv\u001b[107G against\u001b[116Gboth\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bf\u001b[5Gles, so \u001b[1mI'm not touching either until it finishes.\u001b[22m A shared input is frozen for the duration of a phase; the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdiscrepancy becomes evidence at reconciliation rather\u001b[57Gthan a moving target.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[33;1H\u001b[31;3H\u001b[?25h"]
