[846.288981, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe critic is the cheapest safe downgrade.\u001b[48G\u001b[22mIts\u001b[52Gchecks\u001b[59Gare\u001b[63Genumerable\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Gnumeric:\u001b[87Gcausality,\u001b[98Gpositive\u001b[107Gdamping,\u001b[116GPT\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  coincidence, cross-channel and cross-method consist\u001b[57Gncy, SNR above noise\u001b[78Gfloor. I hand it\u001b[95Gthe thr\u001b[103Gsholds;\u001b[111Git\u001b[114Greports\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bpass/fail\u001b[15Gwith\u001b[20Gthe\u001b[24Gnumber.\u001b[32GBut\u001b[36Gthe\u001b[40Gcaveat\u001b[47Gmatters\u001b[55G\u2014\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Gcritic\u001b[68Gexists\u001b[75Gto\u001b[78Gcatch\u001b[84Gsubtle\u001b[91Gerrors,\u001b[99Gand\u001b[103G\u001b[1ma weak critic \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m  \u001b[1mthat pa\u001b[13Gses everything is worse than no critic\u001b[22m, because it manufactures false assurance. Mitigation:\u001b[106Grequire\u001b[114Git\u001b[117Gto\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bprint\u001b[11Gthe\u001b[15Gnumber\u001b[22Gbehind\u001b[29Gevery\u001b[35Gverdict\u001b[43Gso\u001b[46GI\u001b[48Gcan\u001b[52Gaudit\u001b[58Gits\u001b[62Garithmetic\u001b[73Ginstead\u001b[81Gof\u001b[84Gtrusting\u001b[93Gits\u001b[97Gjudgment.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mThe mod\u001b[13Gl choice is not the biggest lever; Step 6 is.\u001b[22m No model swap saves as much as dropping it.\u001b[103G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BAlso\u001b[8Gworth\u001b[14Gsaying:\u001b[22Ga\u001b[24Glarge\u001b[30Gshare\u001b[36Gof\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gspend\u001b[49Gis\u001b[52Gmy\u001b[55Gcontext.\u001b[64GThis\u001b[69Gconversation\u001b[82Gis\u001b[85Glong\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94Gevery\u001b[100Gturn\u001b[105Gre-reads\u001b[114Git.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI'll batch tool calls harder and stop printing long tables.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\